Changelog - Bright Spark Electrical Website
​All notable changes, bug fixes, feature additions, and development updates for this project are logged sequentially below.
​[3.0.0] - 2026-11-02 (Part 3 Implementation)
​Added
​Interactive FAQ Accordion (js/main.js): Implemented expanding/collapsing accordion sections for client query resolution.
​Modal Lightbox Gallery (js/main.js): Added click-to-enlarge modal feature (lightbox-trigger) for viewing high-resolution project images.
​Real-Time Service/Menu Search (js/main.js): Added live text-filtering and category dropdown filtering for pages/menu.html.
​Leaflet.js Interactive Map (js/main.js): Integrated Leaflet open-source map engine pointing to Arcadia, Pretoria (-25.7479, 28.2293).
​Client-Side Validation & Cost Calculator (js/validation.js):
​Configured enquiry.html with price processing (unitPrice * quantity) and urgency multipliers.
​Implemented regex validation for emails and South African telephone numbers with inline error messages.
​Mailto: Email Engine (js/validation.js): Formatted dynamic mailto: string links on contact.html for direct email compilation.
​SEO Assets: Created root-level robots.txt and sitemap.xml files.
​Platform Deployment: Hosted live application on Netlify platform at https://sweetcrumbsbakery.netlify.app.
​Changed
​Header Navigation: Standardized header <nav> markup across index.html and all pages inside pages/.
​On-Page Meta Tags: Added unique title tags, keyword tags, and meta descriptions across all HTML headers.
